    text: "Change\r\nIncrease weekday frequency to 15 minutes from 7:00 a.m. to 7:00 p.m. between US 36 and Dartmouth, and provide 15-minute frequency from 9:00 a.m. to 6:00 p.m. on Saturdays and Sundays.\r\n\nReason\r\nProvide more frequent service during periods of higher customer demand and improve travel options along Sheridan Boulevard."
